{"4112680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "青羽沉梦-终霰篇", "steam_appid": 4112680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“当所有的世界都化为羽毛飘落，你选择拾起哪一片梦境？”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《青羽沉梦》 构建了一个连接无数破碎时空的神秘领域。在初始的梦境大厅中，你可以审视不同世界的遗物，选择开启一段段截然不同的人生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/96ad9f9b4a3b53d4eba8dd87807fe59d.avif?t=1787105208\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当前版本收录首个完整世界——《终霰傩玉录》。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从梦境中踏出一步，你便坠入了古老神秘的东方。 在这个篇章中，你将化身为凡人阿楠，身陷一个名为傩村的绝地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/2a81f3654076c4d313364a310aa1e953.poster.avif?t=1787105208\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/2a81f3654076c4d313364a310aa1e953.webm?t=1787105208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/2a81f3654076c4d313364a310aa1e953.mp4?t=1787105208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>人物介绍：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >神鸟：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一个从不属于任何地方的异乡人。她从西方飞来，带着残破的羽翼和一个早已丢失的故乡的名字。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >她拥有村民们渴望的力量，也承受着这股力量带来的反噬。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/470981af721abcf8e627902fb458b51e.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/470981af721abcf8e627902fb458b51e.webp?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=2258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玉扶夭：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >祠堂里供奉的神像。悲悯、静谧、无所不应。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/17dc9eff4124ca09393f17c96e060068.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/17dc9eff4124ca09393f17c96e060068.webp?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=1549 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >长老/吴守义：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >规矩的化身，也是规矩的囚徒。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >傩村的决策者，慈祥的面孔下总是藏着心事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/43db26623303280a32befecb2eb20831.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/43db26623303280a32befecb2eb20831.webp?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=2258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >赵铁牛：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >阿楠的发小，娘病重在床的庄稼汉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/1cc9b419b99962081f1fa92aa52c3d19.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/1cc9b419b99962081f1fa92aa52c3d19.webp?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=2737 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >神秘人：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一个戴着傩面隐居者，身份神秘。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/a92c08b8dd85655a3fb867fdd7e2161c.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/a92c08b8dd85655a3fb867fdd7e2161c.webp?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=2340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>剧情特色：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >沉浸式体验民俗文化，参与竹卦问天、制卦掷卦等传统仪式，通过观察、对话、水书解谜推动剧情。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>卜卦丢卦</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/5e95b929f85118e7d0689a6f1c3d2b9c.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/5e95b929f85118e7d0689a6f1c3d2b9c.webp?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/585cc767f39dcdc9b9e979cbcef9b6f6.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/585cc767f39dcdc9b9e979cbcef9b6f6.avif?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=958 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>水书傩面解密</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/4bdc0a28aa563b72fa6e780d90702d16.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/4bdc0a28aa563b72fa6e780d90702d16.avif?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=964 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>视觉效果：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主人物Live2d全动态，拥有丰富动作变化</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras/21ba7723e1cdbc70b10acf6dd8a67a61.avif?t=1787105208\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112680/extras_big/21ba7723e1cdbc70b10acf6dd8a67a61.webp?t=1787105208 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>全动态场景，超丰富游戏CG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=